      "id": "U-03",
      "question": "approve and reject are \"Reviewer-only\". What does the system return when a non-reviewer (no X-Reviewer-Id, e.g. operator session) calls them: 401, 403, 409 or something else? And does an approve/reject from a non-reviewer on a non-UNDER_REVIEW request return 409 or the role error first?",
